<title>BELGIUM: EU economic forecast for Portugal.</title>
<headline>EU economic forecast for Portugal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Portugal:</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		2.5	   2.8</p>
<p> Investment			4.5	   5.0</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    3.3	   3.0</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    7.3	   7.1</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 4.0	   2.9</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)  Debt/GDP ratio		 71.1	  69.0</p>
</text>
